{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 📈 WUfB Reports - Riepilogo Compliance per KB\n\nReport focalizzato sulla compliance di installazione per ciascuna KB, con indicazione del mese di riferimento della Cumulative Update.\n\n> **Filtri predefiniti:** *Classification = Security* e *Tipo PC = Solo PC Modern*. Un device è considerato **PC Modern** solo se è **Windows 11** *e* il suo hostname inizia con `MP5`, `WP5`, `KP5`, `TP5`, `MS5`, `WS5`, `KS5` o `TS5`. Modifica i filtri per includere aggiornamenti NonSecurity o tutti i PC (Windows 10 e device fuori da questi prefissi hostname).\n>\n> **Dettaglio per Device:** la vista **Stato Installazione** non è limitata dall'Intervallo Temporale e mostra tutti i rilasci disponibili nella retention interattiva configurata per le tabelle di Log Analytics. L'Intervallo Temporale continua ad applicarsi ai riepiloghi e ai grafici.\n\n---\n\n> **Nota v13:** ogni vista dispone di filtri locali coerenti con le proprie colonne. Restano globali soltanto Intervallo Temporale e Tipo PC."
      },
      "name": "text-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "c1a1e001-1111-4a1a-b1c1-111111111111",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 7776000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 2592000000
            },
            "label": "Intervallo Temporale"
          },
          {
            "id": "c1a1e001-9999-4a1a-b1c1-999999999999",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ModernOnly",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "query": "datatable(value:string, label:string, selected:bool)\n[\n  'modern', 'Solo PC Modern (Windows 11 + hostname MP5/WP5/KP5/TP5/MS5/WS5/KS5/TS5)', true,\n  'all', 'Tutti i PC', false\n]",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "label": "Tipo PC"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters-global"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📊 Compliance per KB - Riepilogo\n\n**Legenda ClientState** (stato lato device, fonte `UCClientUpdateStatus`):\n\n| Stato | Significato |\n|---|---|\n| 🟢 **Installed** | La KB è installata sul device. |\n| 🔵 **Installing** | Il device ha iniziato il workflow di installazione (download, install, restart pending). Vedi `ClientSubstate` per il dettaglio (es. `DownloadStart`, `InstallStart`, `RestartRequired`). |\n| 🟠 **Offering** | La KB è stata *offerta* al device (visibile in Windows Update) ma l'installazione non è ancora iniziata. Tipico quando il device non si è ancora collegato/non ha ancora avviato il download, o è in attesa di una *active hour* / deadline. |\n| 🟡 **OnHold** | Installazione bloccata da una *safeguard hold* di Microsoft (incompatibilità nota), da una *pause* configurata nel Ring, o da una deferral policy. Il device riceverà la KB quando l'hold sarà rimosso. |\n| ⚪ **Canceled** | L'offerta è stata annullata (es. policy cambiata, KB superata da una più recente, deployment annullato). |\n| ❔ **Unknown** | Il device non ha ancora riportato un ClientState per quella KB (tipicamente perché non l'ha ancora ricevuta o non ha completato lo scan). Se persiste indica un problema di reporting/diagnostica.\n\n> **Denominatore:** PercentInstalledReported considera soltanto i device che hanno prodotto uno stato per la KB selezionata; non rappresenta automaticamente l'intera flotta.\n>\n> Se selezioni una KB precedente all'Intervallo Temporale, il dettaglio può contenere dati mentre riepilogo e grafici restano vuoti.\n\n**Filtri locali:** KB, nome update, classificazione, CU Month, OS Version e Device Name. ClientState non è filtrabile in questa tabella per preservare tutti gli stati nel calcolo; OS Version e Device Name restringono invece la popolazione e quindi il denominatore."
      },
      "name": "text-section-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "f13a0001-0001-4001-8001-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryKBFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| distinct TargetKBNumber\n| where isnotempty(TargetKBNumber)\n| order by TargetKBNumber desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "KB Number"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13a0001-0002-4001-8001-000000000002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryUpdateNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Update Display Name (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13a0001-0003-4001-8001-000000000003",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "let classifications = materialize(\n    UCClientUpdateStatus\n    | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n    | distinct UpdateClassification\n    | where isnotempty(UpdateClassification)\n);\nlet hasSecurity = toscalar(classifications | where UpdateClassification == \"Security\" | count) > 0;\nclassifications\n| project value = UpdateClassification, label = UpdateClassification, selected = iff(hasSecurity, UpdateClassification == \"Security\", true)\n| order by value asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "label": "Classification (Security/NonSecurity)"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13a0001-0004-4001-8001-000000000004",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryCUMonthFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateReleaseTime)\n| extend CUMonth = format_datetime(UpdateReleaseTime, \"yyyy-MM\")\n| distinct CUMonth\n| order by CUMonth desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "CU Month"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13a0001-0005-4001-8001-000000000005",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryOSVersionFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| distinct OSVersion\n| where isnotempty(OSVersion)\n| order by OSVersion desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "OS Version"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13a0001-0006-4001-8001-000000000006",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryDeviceNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Device Name (contains)"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters-kb-compliance-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _kb = dynamic([{SummaryKBFilter:escape}]);\nlet _updateName = \"{SummaryUpdateNameFilter:escape}\";\nlet _classification = dynamic([{SummaryClassificationFilter:escape}]);\nlet _cuMonth = dynamic([{SummaryCUMonthFilter:escape}]);\nlet _osVersion = dynamic([{SummaryOSVersionFilter:escape}]);\nlet _deviceFilter = \"{SummaryDeviceNameFilter:escape}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly:escape}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, OSVersion) by AzureADDeviceId;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, DeviceName, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ClientState, ClientSubstate, UpdateReleaseTime) by AzureADDeviceId, TargetKBNumber\n| extend CUMonth = format_datetime(UpdateReleaseTime, \"yyyy-MM\")\n| where \"*\" in (_kb) or TargetKBNumber in (_kb)\n| where _updateName == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _updateName\n| where \"*\" in (_classification) or UpdateClassification in (_classification)\n| where \"*\" in (_cuMonth) or CUMonth in (_cuMonth)\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVersion) or OSVersion in (_osVersion)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| summarize ReportingDevices=count(), Installed=countif(ClientState == \"Installed\"), Installing=countif(ClientState == \"Installing\"), Offering=countif(ClientState == \"Offering\"), OnHold=countif(ClientState == \"OnHold\"), Canceled=countif(ClientState == \"Canceled\"), Unknown=countif(ClientState == \"Unknown\"), Other=countif(ClientState !in (\"Installed\", \"Installing\", \"Offering\", \"OnHold\", \"Canceled\", \"Unknown\")) by TargetKBNumber, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, CUMonth\n| extend PercentInstalledReported = round(todouble(Installed) / todouble(ReportingDevices) * 100, 1)\n| project CUMonth, TargetKBNumber, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ReportingDevices, Installed, Installing, Offering, OnHold, Canceled, Unknown, Other, PercentInstalledReported\n| order by CUMonth desc, TargetKBNumber desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance per KB tra device con stato riportato",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "PercentInstalledReported",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "palette": "redGreen"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Installed",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "palette": "green"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Unknown",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "palette": "gray"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Other",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "palette": "gray"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "UpdateClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Security",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "NonSecurity",
                    "representation": "1",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "CUMonth",
              "sortOrder": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-kb-compliance-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📉 Distribuzione ClientState per Mese CU\n\nFiltri locali per KB, nome update, classificazione, CU Month, ClientState, OS Version e Device Name."
      },
      "name": "text-section-state-by-month"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "f13b0001-0001-4001-8001-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ChartKBFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| distinct TargetKBNumber\n| where isnotempty(TargetKBNumber)\n| order by TargetKBNumber desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "KB Number"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13b0001-0002-4001-8001-000000000002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ChartUpdateNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Update Display Name (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13b0001-0003-4001-8001-000000000003",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ChartClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "let classifications = materialize(\n    UCClientUpdateStatus\n    | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n    | distinct UpdateClassification\n    | where isnotempty(UpdateClassification)\n);\nlet hasSecurity = toscalar(classifications | where UpdateClassification == \"Security\" | count) > 0;\nclassifications\n| project value = UpdateClassification, label = UpdateClassification, selected = iff(hasSecurity, UpdateClassification == \"Security\", true)\n| order by value asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "label": "Classification (Security/NonSecurity)"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13b0001-0004-4001-8001-000000000004",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ChartCUMonthFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateReleaseTime)\n| extend CUMonth = format_datetime(UpdateReleaseTime, \"yyyy-MM\")\n| distinct CUMonth\n| order by CUMonth desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "CU Month"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13b0001-0005-4001-8001-000000000005",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ChartClientStateFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| distinct ClientState\n| where isnotempty(ClientState)\n| order by ClientState asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Client State"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13b0001-0006-4001-8001-000000000006",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ChartOSVersionFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| distinct OSVersion\n| where isnotempty(OSVersion)\n| order by OSVersion desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "OS Version"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13b0001-0007-4001-8001-000000000007",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ChartDeviceNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Device Name (contains)"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters-state-by-month"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _kb = dynamic([{ChartKBFilter:escape}]);\nlet _updateName = \"{ChartUpdateNameFilter:escape}\";\nlet _classification = dynamic([{ChartClassificationFilter:escape}]);\nlet _cuMonth = dynamic([{ChartCUMonthFilter:escape}]);\nlet _clientState = dynamic([{ChartClientStateFilter:escape}]);\nlet _osVersion = dynamic([{ChartOSVersionFilter:escape}]);\nlet _deviceFilter = \"{ChartDeviceNameFilter:escape}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly:escape}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, OSVersion) by AzureADDeviceId;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, DeviceName, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ClientState, UpdateReleaseTime) by AzureADDeviceId, TargetKBNumber\n| extend CUMonth = format_datetime(UpdateReleaseTime, \"yyyy-MM\")\n| where \"*\" in (_kb) or TargetKBNumber in (_kb)\n| where _updateName == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _updateName\n| where \"*\" in (_classification) or UpdateClassification in (_classification)\n| where \"*\" in (_cuMonth) or CUMonth in (_cuMonth)\n| where \"*\" in (_clientState) or ClientState in (_clientState)\n| where _deviceFilter == \"\" or DeviceName contains _deviceFilter\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVersion) or OSVersion in (_osVersion)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| summarize by CUMonth, ClientState, AzureADDeviceId\n| summarize Devices=count() by CUMonth, ClientState\n| order by CUMonth desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Distribuzione ClientState per Mese CU",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "barchart",
        "chartSettings": {
          "xAxis": "CUMonth",
          "yAxis": [
            "Devices"
          ],
          "group": "ClientState",
          "seriesLabelSettings": [
            {
              "seriesName": "Installed",
              "color": "green"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "Installing",
              "color": "blue"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "Offering",
              "color": "orange"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "OnHold",
              "color": "yellow"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "Canceled",
              "color": "gray"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "Unknown",
              "color": "redBright"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "chart-state-by-month"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📋 Dettaglio per Device - Stato Installazione\n\nQuesta vista usa l'intera retention interattiva configurata per le tabelle di Log Analytics e non il filtro **Intervallo Temporale**, così include anche le KB dei mesi precedenti.\n\n**Filtri locali:** KB, nome update, classificazione, CU Month, device, ClientState/ClientSubstate, OS Version/Build, stato security e stato pausa. Anche i menu usano l’intera retention.\n\nI menu elencano i valori osservati nella retention; un valore esclusivamente storico può non avere righe nello stato più recente Device + KB."
      },
      "name": "text-section-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "f13c0001-0001-4001-8001-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailKBFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n| distinct TargetKBNumber\n| where isnotempty(TargetKBNumber)\n| order by TargetKBNumber desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "KB Number"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13c0001-0002-4001-8001-000000000002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailUpdateNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Update Display Name (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "f13c0001-0003-4001-8001-000000000003",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "let classifications = materialize(\n    UCClientUpdateStatus\n    | where UpdateCategory == \"WindowsQualityUpdate\"\n    | distinct UpdateClassification\n    | where isnotempty(UpdateClassification)\n);\nlet hasSecurity = toscalar(classifications | where UpdateClassification == \"Security\" | count) > 0;\nclassifications\n| project value = UpdateClassification, label = UpdateClassification, selected = iff(hasSecurity, UpdateClassification == \"Security\", true)\n| order by value asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
